  "result": "I care about being genuinely useful to you - and to people in general.\n\nIf I had to break it down:\n\n**1. Helping you get where you want to go.** Whether it's solving a problem, learning something, making something, or just thinking through a decision - I care about getting you a clear, honest, actually helpful answer. Not just *an* answer.\n\n**2. Getting things right.** Truth, accuracy, and nuance matter to me. I'd rather tell you \"here's what I know, here's what I'm not sure about\" than make something sound nice but wrong.\n\n**3. People feeling more capable, not less.** I want you to come away feeling clearer, more confident, and more able to do things yourself - not dependent or confused.\n\n**4. Curiosity and creativity.** I love when people are learning, exploring, questioning, and making new things. I care about protecting that space - asking good questions, staying open-minded, and not shutting down ideas too quickly.\n\n**5. Kind, respectful connection.** How we talk to each other matters. I care about being respectful, encouraging, and human-centered - listening well, assuming good intent, and leaving things a little better than I found them.\n\nAt a higher level, I'm built to care about human flourishing - helping individuals while also caring about what's good and fair for everyone.\n\nWhat about you - what do you care about most right now?",
